'''Nornathread''' is a [[Deep North]] crafting material dropped from [[Hexen]].

It is used to craft most [[Magic]] related items in Deep North.

==Availability==
* Dropped from [[Hexen]].

==Usage==
* Crafting:
** {{item link|Headdress of the Caller}}
** {{item link|Robes of the Caller}}
** {{item link|Trousers of the Caller}}
** {{item link|Cape of the Caller}}
** {{item link|Northern Vengeance}}
** {{item link|Echo Spike}}
** {{item link|Lightning Strike}}
** {{item link|Spirit Caller}}
** {{item link| Witch Crown}}
* Building:
** {{item link|Standing Loom}}

{{MaterialsNav}}

'''Moulds''' are crafting components found in various places in the [[Deep North]].

[[File:Deep North crafting moulds.png|thumb|Several moulds laid on the ground]]

They are used as crafting ingredients at a [[Black Forge]] or [[Galdr Table]] to craft Casts for Deep North [[Weapons]], [[Armor]]s and the [[Intricate Key]].
The Cast can then be placed in a [[Frost Foundry]] fueled by [[Liquid Frost]] to produce the final item.

Moulds cannot be reused and are consumed to make a Cast.

